WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.096
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:48.571 --> 00:00:49.670
Kim Young Soo!

3
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.349
Lim Sol!

4
00:00:53.487 --> 00:00:54.586
Salt!

5
00:01:17.742 --> 00:01:20.040
The future has changed.

6
00:01:22.098 --> 00:01:23.197
Salt!

7
00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.075
Song Jae...

8
00:01:25.574 --> 00:01:26.993
what should we do?

9
00:01:32.448 --> 00:01:34.066
EPISODE 13

10
00:01:36.803 --> 00:01:38.102
What are you thinking about?

11
00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:42.498
Yes, nothing.

12
00:01:45.754 --> 00:01:48.767
By the way, where did these idiots go?

13
00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:52.448
Faster, faster! We're late.
The train will arrive soon.

14
00:01:53.187 --> 00:01:54.286
Faster.

15
00:01:55.145 --> 00:01:56.244
Let's go.

16
00:02:36.663 --> 00:02:38.042
Shall we listen to music?

17
00:02:41.099 --> 00:02:42.198
Salt.

18
00:02:45.175 --> 00:02:46.274
Salt?

19
00:02:56.124 --> 00:02:57.543
Did you fall asleep?

20
00:02:57.602 --> 00:02:59.061
Where am I?

21
00:03:02.198 --> 00:03:03.297
What's happened?

22
00:03:06.873 --> 00:03:08.971
And why are you next to me?

23
00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:16.004
Salt! What's wrong with you?

24
00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.239
Really...

25
00:03:22.817 --> 00:03:23.916
you...

26
00:03:27.013 --> 00:03:28.432
back to the future?

27
00:03:29.131 --> 00:03:30.470
Let go!

28
00:03:31.968 --> 00:03:33.587
- Salt!
- Don't come closer!

29
00:03:34.565 --> 00:03:37.023
I was a little confused.

30
00:03:37.682 --> 00:03:39.501
I have to go. Sorry.

31
00:04:17.562 --> 00:04:19.740
I will change my destiny myself.

32
00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.018
Therefore, Sung Jae...

33
00:04:22.717 --> 00:04:25.535
don't come this time.

34
00:05:08.631 --> 00:05:11.129
A COUPLE OF DAYS AGO

35
00:05:12.747 --> 00:05:13.846
What is this?

36
00:05:14.226 --> 00:05:18.122
Damn, bad luck again.
And the prize is 7,500,000.

37
00:05:21.099 --> 00:05:22.917
- Millions?
- Yes.

38
00:05:25.894 --> 00:05:27.948
- Where to look?
- Here.

39
00:05:27.972 --> 00:05:30.150
These numbers will change your life.

40
00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.589
Consider it a gift.

41
00:05:31.768 --> 00:05:35.185
- Where from?
- A generous person shared.

42
00:05:35.325 --> 00:05:36.943
Winning numbers?

43
00:05:37.043 --> 00:05:38.502
How generous is he?

44
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.694
Please be patient.

45
00:05:41.718 --> 00:05:44.252
Don't give up if it doesn't work out
right the first time.

46
00:05:44.276 --> 00:05:45.375
Understood?

47
00:05:45.594 --> 00:05:46.813
Yes, I understand.

48
00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:49.770
Hyun Joo, I did everything I could.

49
00:06:06.254 --> 00:06:08.552
- Happy birthday!
- Thank you.

50
00:06:09.011 --> 00:06:10.110
Let's go.

51
00:06:13.207 --> 00:06:15.185
There are better parks in the city,

52
00:06:15.604 --> 00:06:16.743
but did you choose this one?

53
00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:20.819
When dad was still alive,
we came here every year.

54
00:06:21.079 --> 00:06:22.853
That's why I brought you here.

55
00:06:22.877 --> 00:06:24.296
I would have said it right away.

56
00:06:25.275 --> 00:06:26.733
It's the same here.

57
00:06:27.712 --> 00:06:29.091
And in the future too?

58
00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.369
Maybe.

59
00:06:32.507 --> 00:06:33.886
Then we'll come again.

60
00:06:34.825 --> 00:06:36.564
See you in the future...

61
00:06:38.062 --> 00:06:39.321
and we'll come here.

62
00:06:41.139 --> 00:06:42.238
Fine.

63
00:06:43.097 --> 00:06:46.953
I also hope that this time -
not the last.

64
00:06:52.208 --> 00:06:53.307
Let's go.

65
00:07:30.969 --> 00:07:33.467
Song Jae, where to? Don't eat it whole!

66
00:07:37.483 --> 00:07:38.781
That's it, I'm leaving.

67
00:08:03.097 --> 00:08:05.834
I feel somehow uneasy.

68
00:08:06.054 --> 00:08:07.153
Yes?

69
00:08:07.852 --> 00:08:10.310
If so, hold on to me.

70
00:08:12.567 --> 00:08:13.666
Let's go.

71
00:08:14.406 --> 00:08:15.505
Let's go.

72
00:08:17.083 --> 00:08:19.581
Crap. They stuck everything here.

73
00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:31.089
Wow!

74
00:08:32.667 --> 00:08:33.766
Scary?

75
00:08:34.066 --> 00:08:35.445
What are you really...

76
00:08:38.222 --> 00:08:39.920
Not scary at all.

77
00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.198
Doll. My God.

78
00:08:42.857 --> 00:08:43.956
What's happened?

79
00:08:47.732 --> 00:08:50.949
Come on, Sung Jae. Aren't you scared?

80
00:08:52.368 --> 00:08:54.186
Where did you run away to?

81
00:09:01.399 --> 00:09:03.217
Where did he get lost?

82
00:09:04.196 --> 00:09:05.295
Salt!

83
00:09:06.673 --> 00:09:09.371
- Sorry.
- Come on in.

84
00:09:17.423 --> 00:09:19.556
What is this? Did you run to the store for this?

85
00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.439
Yes. All out of breath.

86
00:09:21.858 --> 00:09:24.356
Well, it's time to blow out the candles.

87
00:09:27.572 --> 00:09:30.466
- Happy birthday.
- Aren’t you going to sing a song?

88
00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:33.107
Wow, I'm front row at the concert
Ryu Sung Jae.

89
00:09:36.244 --> 00:09:38.777
Happy birthday to you.

90
00:09:38.801 --> 00:09:40.975
Happy birthday to you.

91
00:09:40.999 --> 00:09:43.976
Happy birthday, my Sol.

92
00:09:44.196 --> 00:09:46.693
Happy birthday to you!

93
00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:52.887
Thank you.

94
00:09:54.545 --> 00:09:56.164
Look in the left pocket.

95
00:10:02.058 --> 00:10:03.836
When did you have time? What is this?

96
00:10:04.136 --> 00:10:05.235
Open up.

97
00:10:17.043 --> 00:10:18.382
Why are you silent?

98
00:10:18.881 --> 00:10:19.980
Didn't like it?

99
00:10:21.798 --> 00:10:22.897
No.

100
00:10:23.237 --> 00:10:24.376
Beautiful.

101
00:10:27.393 --> 00:10:29.730
So beautiful that I have no words.

102
00:10:32.547 --> 00:10:33.646
That's good.

103
00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:35.604
Can you try it on already?

104
00:10:36.024 --> 00:10:37.403
Let's. I'll help.

105
00:10:48.452 --> 00:10:49.990
It doesn't work.

106
00:10:52.647 --> 00:10:55.105
And in TV series they wear it without any problems.

107
00:10:55.724 --> 00:10:57.423
- I can do it myself.
- Almost.

108
00:10:59.201 --> 00:11:00.300
All.

109
00:11:01.439 --> 00:11:02.538
What do you have here?

110
00:11:02.797 --> 00:11:05.095
I'll spin the wheel one more time.

111
00:11:05.235 --> 00:11:06.609
Have a nice evening.

112
00:11:06.633 --> 00:11:08.927
Don't get distracted, continue.

113
00:11:08.951 --> 00:11:10.769
One more lap!

114
00:11:12.268 --> 00:11:15.001
It seems he misunderstood us.

115
00:11:15.025 --> 00:11:17.483
I don't know, but it will be awkward to go out.

116
00:11:21.538 --> 00:11:22.637
Beauty.

117
00:11:29.011 --> 00:11:30.470
Indeed, beauty.

118
00:11:31.169 --> 00:11:32.268
Thank you.

119
00:11:32.488 --> 00:11:33.786
Thank you...

120
00:11:34.166 --> 00:11:35.265
that she was born.

121
00:11:38.322 --> 00:11:40.739
You've come a long way...

122
00:11:41.998 --> 00:11:44.895
so that I can be close.

123
00:11:47.273 --> 00:11:48.452
Thank you, Sol.

124
00:11:51.269 --> 00:11:52.368
Song Jae...

125
00:11:53.347 --> 00:11:57.483
now you don't know it
but saved me from death

126
00:11:58.022 --> 00:12:00.240
and brought back to life again -

127
00:12:02.258 --> 00:12:03.437
exactly you.

128
00:12:03.696 --> 00:12:05.115
Is it true?

129
00:12:07.732 --> 00:12:09.151
Therefore...

130
00:12:10.729 --> 00:12:12.508
thank you.

131
00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.499
Thank you?

132
00:12:22.877 --> 00:12:23.976
Is that all?

133
00:12:27.512 --> 00:12:29.690
They wished us a good evening.

134
00:12:32.428 --> 00:12:35.405
Just thanked
and are you already expecting something in return?

135
00:12:35.504 --> 00:12:37.163
How shameless!

136
00:12:38.581 --> 00:12:39.760
I've always been like this.

137
00:13:18.142 --> 00:13:21.039
If suddenly tomorrow I...

138
00:13:21.259 --> 00:13:22.358
No.

139
00:13:23.337 --> 00:13:25.315
I'll be back today...

140
00:13:27.013 --> 00:13:28.512
don't be upset.

141
00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.908
And just don't cry.

142
00:13:43.956 --> 00:13:45.850
- Welcome!
- Hello!

143
00:13:45.874 --> 00:13:47.892
Yes, good evening. I...

144
00:13:48.671 --> 00:13:51.245
I'm Detective Kim On Joo from Gangmu Station.

145
00:13:51.269 --> 00:13:54.685
What? What business are you on?

146
00:13:57.822 --> 00:14:00.436
You don't even know
will the criminal appear?

147
00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.198
should we wait for him?

148
00:14:02.338 --> 00:14:03.437
Are you a shaman?

149
00:14:04.695 --> 00:14:06.434
And who will believe me?

150
00:14:07.133 --> 00:14:08.592
What to do?

151
00:14:12.248 --> 00:14:13.427
MOM

152
00:14:16.124 --> 00:14:17.299
Yes, mom.

153
00:14:17.323 --> 00:14:19.101
Come immediately.

154
00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.859
What?

155
00:14:20.959 --> 00:14:23.736
I told you I'll be back tomorrow.

156
00:14:24.036 --> 00:14:25.215
Last year...

157
00:14:26.114 --> 00:14:27.612
were you kidnapped?

158
00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:32.523
How did you find out about this?

159
00:14:32.547 --> 00:14:34.961
Detective Kim told everything.

160
00:14:34.985 --> 00:14:38.398
You barely escaped the killer
and didn’t say a word to us?

161
00:14:38.422 --> 00:14:41.674
- You see...
- Come home immediately.

162
00:14:41.698 --> 00:14:45.231
This freak is still walking free
he hasn't been caught yet!

163
00:14:45.255 --> 00:14:47.149
Where are you going?

164
00:14:47.173 --> 00:14:49.307
No, no, no. I'll come for you myself.

165
00:14:49.331 --> 00:14:51.065
Stay in a crowded place.

166
00:14:51.089 --> 00:14:52.827
Mom, calm down. Fine?

167
00:14:53.886 --> 00:14:55.700
I told you that we are with the guys.

168
00:14:55.724 --> 00:14:57.139
Sun Jae is nearby. What could happen?

169
00:14:57.163 --> 00:14:58.577
Is Sun Jae nearby?

170
00:14:58.601 --> 00:14:59.816
Certainly!

171
00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:03.093
And his friend’s dad also promised
take us to the station tomorrow.

172
00:15:03.117 --> 00:15:05.890
If we leave now, he will be offended.

173
00:15:05.914 --> 00:15:08.328
Then don't walk alone, go into a crowded place...

174
00:15:08.352 --> 00:15:10.410
No, don't take a single step away from Sun Jae.

175
00:15:12.507 --> 00:15:14.246
Sorry I didn't tell you.

176
00:15:14.346 --> 00:15:15.804
I'll come home...

177
00:15:16.344 --> 00:15:17.802
and I'll explain everything.

178
00:15:17.942 --> 00:15:19.041
Fine.

179
00:15:19.101 --> 00:15:20.759
Be careful, brat.

180
00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.826
- My God.
- Brat? At least have pity on the child!

181
00:15:34.166 --> 00:15:35.820
No need to be angry with her.

182
00:15:35.844 --> 00:15:38.222
I'm just worried!

183
00:15:38.521 --> 00:15:40.935
It's like being scared
to forget everything.

184
00:15:40.959 --> 00:15:43.377
And I, fool, didn’t even guess.

185
00:15:43.716 --> 00:15:45.930
She screamed at her. My God.

186
00:15:45.954 --> 00:15:47.053
God.

187
00:15:51.109 --> 00:15:53.207
- Hello.
- Sung Jae.

188
00:15:53.506 --> 00:15:54.765
-Where is Sol?
- Is there salt at home?

189
00:15:55.984 --> 00:15:57.838
Wasn't she with you?

190
00:15:57.862 --> 00:16:00.600
She told me not to worry - you are together.

191
00:16:02.098 --> 00:16:03.197
She said...

192
00:16:03.457 --> 00:16:04.711
what are we together?

193
00:16:04.735 --> 00:16:05.830
Yes.

194
00:16:05.854 --> 00:16:06.953
When?

195
00:16:07.013 --> 00:16:08.432
Yes, just recently.

196
00:16:08.531 --> 00:16:09.630
What?

197
00:16:13.886 --> 00:16:14.985
Salt!

198
00:16:15.045 --> 00:16:16.144
What's wrong with you?

199
00:16:16.563 --> 00:16:19.780
- Let go!
- She was wearing a watch.

200
00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:23.253
If she came back
why is the clock left?

201
00:16:23.277 --> 00:16:24.376
Song Jae.

202
00:16:24.595 --> 00:16:27.493
If suddenly tomorrow I...

203
00:16:28.072 --> 00:16:29.171
No.

204
00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:32.128
I'll be back today...

205
00:16:32.388 --> 00:16:33.926
don't be upset.

206
00:16:35.305 --> 00:16:36.763
Where am I?

207
00:16:37.542 --> 00:16:39.561
And why are you next to me?

208
00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:41.599
She...

209
00:16:41.938 --> 00:16:43.037
deceived me?

210
00:16:45.534 --> 00:16:47.832
What should happen on May 10?

211
00:16:48.012 --> 00:16:50.709
We're wasting the whole day
and even in such a place.

212
00:16:51.768 --> 00:16:54.825
Okay for you. Let's help the girl.

213
00:16:56.004 --> 00:16:58.821
Is it because she's Taesung's friend?

214
00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:01.858
That's not the only reason.

215
00:17:01.958 --> 00:17:03.972
My soul is restless.

216
00:17:03.996 --> 00:17:05.694
You can't leave her.

217
00:17:11.189 --> 00:17:12.368
Yes, I'm listening.

218
00:17:12.468 --> 00:17:13.567
Yes.

219
00:17:15.345 --> 00:17:16.444
What?

220
00:17:16.583 --> 00:17:17.682
Understood.

221
00:17:18.541 --> 00:17:21.235
- What's happened?
- It seems that Kim Yong Soo left Seoul.

222
00:17:21.259 --> 00:17:23.353
He was spotted on the way to Busan.

223
00:17:23.377 --> 00:17:26.549
The guys have already checked the cameras.
Everything came together.

224
00:17:26.573 --> 00:17:28.192
- To Busan?
- Yes.

225
00:17:30.809 --> 00:17:33.063
Hello? Yes, I'm listening, Sol.

226
00:17:33.087 --> 00:17:35.025
Hello, detective.

227
00:17:35.285 --> 00:17:37.099
Can you help me today?

228
00:17:37.123 --> 00:17:38.977
How? Where are you?

229
00:17:39.001 --> 00:17:41.658
I have no one else to turn to.

230
00:17:42.557 --> 00:17:43.656
Detective...

231
00:17:43.996 --> 00:17:45.575
save me.

232
00:18:04.336 --> 00:18:07.273
The subscriber is temporarily unavailable...

233
00:18:10.729 --> 00:18:12.787
May 10. Maybe...

234
00:18:13.487 --> 00:18:14.581
...will come.

235
00:18:14.605 --> 00:18:16.180
There is still time.

236
00:18:16.204 --> 00:18:17.583
What was she up to?

237
00:18:18.082 --> 00:18:19.301
Why did you lie to me?

238
00:18:20.759 --> 00:18:21.858
Maybe...

239
00:18:22.158 --> 00:18:23.537
Has the future changed?

240
00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.687
- Yes.
- Listen, Lim Sol hasn’t left anywhere.

241
00:18:32.907 --> 00:18:34.681
- What?
- Dad called.

242
00:18:34.705 --> 00:18:37.882
He said he saw her when he was fishing.
We boarded the train together.

243
00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.478
Why didn't you fly away?

244
00:18:42.617 --> 00:18:44.076
Why?

245
00:18:44.216 --> 00:18:46.470
I had to fly!

246
00:18:46.494 --> 00:18:49.227
What will you do now?

247
00:18:49.251 --> 00:18:51.025
Don't notice me.

248
00:18:51.049 --> 00:18:54.781
Wherever I am, whatever I do
and no matter what happens.

249
00:18:54.805 --> 00:18:56.903
Forget me, Sung Jae. Please.

250
00:18:57.163 --> 00:18:58.262
She...

251
00:18:58.641 --> 00:19:00.420
walking there alone?

252
00:19:21.938 --> 00:19:23.437
Indeed, beauty.

253
00:19:24.096 --> 00:19:25.275
Thank you.

254
00:19:26.014 --> 00:19:27.273
Thank you...

255
00:19:27.692 --> 00:19:28.831
that she was born.

256
00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:32.508
You've come a long way...

257
00:19:33.726 --> 00:19:36.584
so that I can be close.

258
00:19:39.001 --> 00:19:40.100
Thank you, Sol.

259
00:19:56.224 --> 00:19:58.002
Sorry, Sung Jae.

260
00:19:58.901 --> 00:20:00.240
But...

261
00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.558
you can't come here.

262
00:20:22.757 --> 00:20:27.209
- That's what I told her.
- Yes, it's time to stop. This is not possible.

263
00:20:27.233 --> 00:20:30.849
This is some kind of chaos, tell me?

264
00:20:31.908 --> 00:20:33.363
What about her?

265
00:20:33.387 --> 00:20:37.279
And she got angry
doesn't want to hear anything.

266
00:20:37.303 --> 00:20:38.961
My God.

267
00:21:08.631 --> 00:21:10.885
- So, did you quarrel?
- No no.

268
00:21:10.909 --> 00:21:13.127
Five o'clock in the morning.

269
00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.038
Whale on the wall.

270
00:21:43.956 --> 00:21:45.814
Red brick.

271
00:21:52.667 --> 00:21:54.841
- One more.
- Yes, let's do it.

272
00:21:54.865 --> 00:21:56.164
Am I pouring?

273
00:22:03.057 --> 00:22:05.155
-Are you alone?
- Yes.

274
00:22:05.614 --> 00:22:07.668
Bring something.

275
00:22:07.692 --> 00:22:08.791
OK.

276
00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:32.607
Sol, where are you going?

277
00:22:32.667 --> 00:22:34.006
I met my mother.

278
00:22:34.505 --> 00:22:36.120
Please answer.

279
00:22:36.144 --> 00:22:39.636
Sun Jae, wait a little longer.

280
00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:42.038
It will all be over soon.

281
00:23:04.156 --> 00:23:08.132
When will Detective Kim arrive?
It's almost five.

282
00:23:14.545 --> 00:23:16.364
Hello? Detective Kim?

283
00:23:16.424 --> 00:23:17.722
Yes, we are there.

284
00:23:18.422 --> 00:23:20.000
Right behind you.

285
00:23:20.859 --> 00:23:22.278
We'll keep an eye on it.

286
00:23:23.976 --> 00:23:25.954
- Thank you for coming.
- My pleasure.

287
00:23:33.087 --> 00:23:35.545
Do you really think
that Kim Young Soo will appear?

288
00:23:35.964 --> 00:23:37.423
He's somewhere at the bottom of the sea.

289
00:23:38.482 --> 00:23:41.938
His face is on every pillar
the whole country is on ears,

290
00:23:42.078 --> 00:23:46.613
and he runs away from Seoul to Busan,
does he even get caught on camera?

291
00:23:46.753 --> 00:23:51.125
So this idiot is on purpose
leads us along?

292
00:23:51.149 --> 00:23:52.248
But why?

293
00:23:52.308 --> 00:23:53.886
We'll find out soon.

294
00:23:56.144 --> 00:23:58.122
Where did he see Salt?

295
00:23:58.342 --> 00:24:00.719
Don't know. Probably on the embankment.

296
00:24:03.457 --> 00:24:04.675
My God.

297
00:24:05.055 --> 00:24:07.353
- Here, take it.
- There's a lot here.

298
00:24:17.962 --> 00:24:19.221
Five o'clock.

299
00:24:26.314 --> 00:24:27.413
Now.

300
00:25:01.958 --> 00:25:03.137
Right here.

301
00:25:46.953 --> 00:25:48.052
Salt!

302
00:25:48.671 --> 00:25:49.770
Salt!

303
00:26:12.208 --> 00:26:13.307
Salt!

304
00:26:31.988 --> 00:26:33.087
Here.

305
00:26:46.893 --> 00:26:47.992
Once...

306
00:26:48.851 --> 00:26:50.989
Show your ID.

307
00:26:52.488 --> 00:26:56.024
Two, three, four...

308
00:26:56.763 --> 00:26:57.862
five...

309
00:26:59.560 --> 00:27:00.655
Kim Young Soo.

310
00:27:00.679 --> 00:27:02.498
Detective Kim!

311
00:27:03.117 --> 00:27:04.216
Out of the way!

312
00:27:04.476 --> 00:27:06.334
Detective Kim!

313
00:27:13.626 --> 00:27:14.845
Everything is fine?

314
00:27:19.341 --> 00:27:21.079
Damn it.

315
00:27:21.459 --> 00:27:24.436
Sorry. We came on call.

316
00:27:24.895 --> 00:27:26.394
Did something happen to you?

317
00:27:26.653 --> 00:27:28.232
Are you here on call?

318
00:27:28.531 --> 00:27:30.430
- Yes.
- Salt!

319
00:27:30.849 --> 00:27:32.947
- How are you?
- What happened?

320
00:27:38.521 --> 00:27:39.620
Crap!

321
00:27:41.758 --> 00:27:42.977
Sorry.

322
00:27:48.392 --> 00:27:51.564
The suspect's name is Kim Young Soo.

323
00:27:51.588 --> 00:27:56.004
The approximate height of the criminal is 180 cm,
Eye color - brown, strong build.

324
00:27:57.143 --> 00:27:58.242
Kim Young Soo?

325
00:28:06.494 --> 00:28:07.628
We got a call.

326
00:28:07.652 --> 00:28:10.745
They said the girl was in danger.
So we left.

327
00:28:10.769 --> 00:28:12.903
Did one of her friends call?

328
00:28:12.927 --> 00:28:16.340
Yes. It seemed to me
that that person knows her.

329
00:28:16.364 --> 00:28:17.463
Really...

330
00:28:18.561 --> 00:28:19.660
Song Jae!

331
00:28:20.400 --> 00:28:21.499
No!

332
00:28:23.077 --> 00:28:25.291
- Salt!
-Where is she going?

333
00:28:25.315 --> 00:28:26.569
- Salt!
- Detective Kim!

334
00:28:26.593 --> 00:28:28.092
What's happened?

335
00:28:39.341 --> 00:28:40.440
Please.

336
00:28:40.619 --> 00:28:42.438
Please, not now.

337
00:29:38.202 --> 00:29:39.700
No, no, no.

338
00:29:41.159 --> 00:29:42.857
Sometimes we make a decision...

339
00:29:43.516 --> 00:29:45.495
already knowing the result.

340
00:29:47.872 --> 00:29:49.451
It suits us.

341
00:29:53.506 --> 00:29:54.765
I like you.

342
00:29:55.664 --> 00:29:57.243
I like you, Sung Jae.

343
00:29:59.301 --> 00:30:00.400
I love you.

344
00:30:01.299 --> 00:30:02.558
I love you, Sol.

345
00:30:06.014 --> 00:30:07.632
Song Jae!

346
00:30:18.322 --> 00:30:20.939
Song Jae!

347
00:30:28.791 --> 00:30:31.608
Sun Jae, it's already morning.

348
00:30:34.026 --> 00:30:35.604
It's time to wake up.

349
00:30:38.781 --> 00:30:40.799
Get up, Sung Jae.

350
00:30:41.618 --> 00:30:44.036
The sun is shining outside the window.

351
00:30:56.563 --> 00:30:57.822
Close your eyes.

352
00:30:58.881 --> 00:31:01.539
Close your eyes and it will become dark.

353
00:31:02.398 --> 00:31:05.055
-Are you awake?
- No, I didn’t wake up.

354
00:31:06.434 --> 00:31:08.132
It's still night in my world.

355
00:31:09.471 --> 00:31:10.809
What are you talking about?

356
00:31:11.189 --> 00:31:13.407
I wish there was no tomorrow.

357
00:31:13.826 --> 00:31:15.565
And it won't come...

358
00:31:16.024 --> 00:31:17.523
until I open my eyes.

359
00:31:27.333 --> 00:31:29.670
So, let's not open our eyes?

360
00:31:31.329 --> 00:31:32.747
So what then?

361
00:31:33.127 --> 00:31:34.905
We'll stay here forever.

362
00:31:44.755 --> 00:31:47.053
You just didn't get enough sleep last night.

363
00:31:49.670 --> 00:31:50.849
How did you understand?

364
00:31:53.826 --> 00:31:55.964
Let's just lie like this for a while longer.

365
00:31:57.702 --> 00:31:58.801
Come on, Sol.

366
00:32:08.292 --> 00:32:11.509
Song Jae-uh!

367
00:32:24.595 --> 00:32:25.934
Song Jae...

368
00:32:26.354 --> 00:32:28.132
in your world...

369
00:32:28.312 --> 00:32:29.690
more...

370
00:32:30.150 --> 00:32:31.249
...night?

371
00:32:53.686 --> 00:32:56.224
Hush, hush, baby.

372
00:33:20.899 --> 00:33:23.317
I returned to my time.

373
00:33:23.497 --> 00:33:25.555
The months flew by one after another.

374
00:33:26.374 --> 00:33:28.711
And winter has come again.

375
00:33:30.050 --> 00:33:33.662
Come on, open your mouth. Like this.
Tasty? Tasty? Of course it's delicious!

376
00:33:33.686 --> 00:33:35.580
Careful, careful.

377
00:33:35.604 --> 00:33:38.178
We're late, we're late! Bo Ah, let's go.

378
00:33:38.202 --> 00:33:39.936
I don't want to go anywhere.

379
00:33:39.960 --> 00:33:42.334
Mom needs to go to work. Let's go.

380
00:33:42.358 --> 00:33:44.132
Don't go, don't go.

381
00:33:44.156 --> 00:33:45.850
No, Mrs. Mal Ja.

382
00:33:45.874 --> 00:33:47.728
- Don't go!
- Darling, darling!

383
00:33:47.752 --> 00:33:49.526
- Come here, come.
- You forgot your backpack.

384
00:33:49.550 --> 00:33:51.564
So, let's get dressed and go out.

385
00:33:51.588 --> 00:33:53.327
Don't go, little sister!

386
00:33:55.904 --> 00:33:58.158
Yes, Min Jae, what is it?

387
00:33:58.182 --> 00:34:01.075
Who offended you? What's happened?
What's happened?

388
00:34:01.099 --> 00:34:03.397
Shall we eat? Will you eat more?

389
00:34:03.656 --> 00:34:04.755
Min Jae!

390
00:34:07.453 --> 00:34:08.831
SCRIPT OF THE FILM "RUN"

391
00:34:10.649 --> 00:34:12.907
I've changed a lot, but...

392
00:34:13.007 --> 00:34:14.825
I lost the most valuable thing.

393
00:34:19.880 --> 00:34:21.978
FAN MEETING WITH IN HYUK

394
00:34:28.711 --> 00:34:34.006
And now I live like this
as if nothing had happened.

395
00:34:39.141 --> 00:34:41.479
Please. Coffee delivery.

396
00:34:41.698 --> 00:34:43.157
Thanks a lot.

397
00:34:44.735 --> 00:34:45.834
Did you get there?

398
00:34:46.214 --> 00:34:47.393
You can live.

399
00:34:47.652 --> 00:34:49.391
You left before me.

400
00:34:49.810 --> 00:34:52.827
Teacher Bo Ah called and summoned him to school.

401
00:34:52.887 --> 00:34:55.261
She's naughty
can't get used to his brother.

402
00:34:55.285 --> 00:34:56.983
I'm worried.

403
00:34:58.681 --> 00:35:00.535
Doesn't the CEO know I'm late?

404
00:35:00.559 --> 00:35:04.296
I already told her that you are in a meeting.

405
00:35:04.515 --> 00:35:06.613
It was like you felt it. Thank you!

406
00:35:07.512 --> 00:35:10.609
You were with CEO Lee yesterday
discussed the script.

407
00:35:11.229 --> 00:35:12.328
And what is she?

408
00:35:12.867 --> 00:35:15.205
John Hoon, did you make your own coffee?

409
00:35:15.664 --> 00:35:18.158
- Tasteless?
- Not tasty at all.

410
00:35:18.182 --> 00:35:19.281
What?

411
00:35:19.500 --> 00:35:22.553
Doesn't even understand what genre
this is attributed.

412
00:35:22.577 --> 00:35:25.550
And the scale will not allow us
promote this film.

413
00:35:25.574 --> 00:35:29.031
The only way out is
take a popular actor.

414
00:35:30.849 --> 00:35:32.104
She's right, okay.

415
00:35:32.128 --> 00:35:33.942
Me too, you're right.

416
00:35:33.966 --> 00:35:37.343
She can't tell the difference between a latte and a cappuccino.
what to say about films.

417
00:35:37.403 --> 00:35:41.894
To be honest, she has no taste.
Do you remember the script for "Hero".

418
00:35:41.918 --> 00:35:43.736
Has she gone crazy?

419
00:35:43.996 --> 00:35:45.371
Yes, yes, yes!

420
00:35:45.395 --> 00:35:48.128
Mermaid and North Korean soldier
kill zombies

421
00:35:48.152 --> 00:35:51.289
and then fly into space.
What kind of plot is this?

422
00:35:51.429 --> 00:35:54.765
Yes. We will definitely collect 7000, right?

423
00:35:55.385 --> 00:35:57.159
I'm just motivating you this way.

424
00:35:57.183 --> 00:36:00.240
You know how much I respect you,
Mrs. Li.

425
00:36:00.699 --> 00:36:04.036
Well, I have a meeting. I'll go now.

426
00:36:09.650 --> 00:36:11.389
- Producer Lim.
- Yes?

427
00:36:11.449 --> 00:36:12.667
Come and see me.

428
00:36:15.365 --> 00:36:17.063
Go to the set.

429
00:36:17.522 --> 00:36:19.740
What? Problems again?

430
00:36:21.119 --> 00:36:23.577
Our dear Park Do Joon...

431
00:36:23.796 --> 00:36:25.854
refuses to kiss.

432
00:36:26.513 --> 00:36:29.686
But this is melodrama, we can't
remove the kiss scene.

433
00:36:29.710 --> 00:36:32.488
So go and convince him.

434
00:36:32.907 --> 00:36:35.361
The director is furious
demands to replace the actor.

435
00:36:35.385 --> 00:36:40.200
But sponsors will also leave with Do Joon.
Then you will have to abandon the project.

436
00:36:40.819 --> 00:36:42.158
This is unacceptable.

437
00:36:43.536 --> 00:36:45.111
What does his agency do?

438
00:36:45.135 --> 00:36:46.909
I constantly solve these problems.

439
00:36:46.933 --> 00:36:52.548
The agency's general director deeply respects
the actor's opinion, as I heard.

440
00:36:53.487 --> 00:36:54.865
This is his nephew.

441
00:37:14.745 --> 00:37:17.563
This means there is no control over him.

442
00:37:18.342 --> 00:37:20.959
Oh my God, Do Joon!

443
00:37:23.057 --> 00:37:25.031
You have become even more beautiful!

444
00:37:25.055 --> 00:37:26.949
You shine all over, so bright!

445
00:37:26.973 --> 00:37:29.710
You blind, you blind!

446
00:37:29.930 --> 00:37:32.308
Aunty producer, you again?

447
00:37:32.607 --> 00:37:35.305
I miss you so much. Certainly!

448
00:37:37.163 --> 00:37:38.422
It smells like fumes.

449
00:37:40.679 --> 00:37:42.498
Did you drink anything?

450
00:37:43.556 --> 00:37:45.575
I hope it's soup.

451
00:37:46.474 --> 00:37:47.573
Auntie producer...

452
00:37:48.072 --> 00:37:49.291
do you like whiskey?

453
00:37:50.110 --> 00:37:53.007
- You can't drink while filming!
- Wow.

454
00:37:53.347 --> 00:37:56.204
I think your name was Soup?

455
00:37:56.623 --> 00:37:58.082
Lim...

456
00:37:58.222 --> 00:37:59.321
...Soup?

457
00:38:00.899 --> 00:38:03.157
Not Soup, but Salt.

458
00:38:04.895 --> 00:38:06.873
So you don't want to kiss?

459
00:38:07.013 --> 00:38:08.711
Why?

460
00:38:10.010 --> 00:38:12.503
Until this scene is removed,
I won't act.

461
00:38:12.527 --> 00:38:14.186
I can't.

462
00:38:15.365 --> 00:38:16.464
Before June...

463
00:38:16.763 --> 00:38:18.422
what's the name of the movie?

464
00:38:22.717 --> 00:38:25.051
"Kissing time", here.

465
00:38:25.075 --> 00:38:27.129
And how can there be no kisses?

466
00:38:27.153 --> 00:38:29.207
"Kissing time"

467
00:38:29.231 --> 00:38:30.809
It hasn't come yet.

468
00:38:31.189 --> 00:38:32.528
No no.

469
00:38:33.267 --> 00:38:36.200
We can't remove this scene, Do Joon.

470
00:38:36.224 --> 00:38:38.282
It's like a cream bun without the cream.

471
00:38:38.422 --> 00:38:39.476
It doesn't happen like that!

472
00:38:39.500 --> 00:38:41.315
The Red Sea is not red.

473
00:38:41.339 --> 00:38:42.917
And the Black Sea is not black.

474
00:38:43.616 --> 00:38:45.395
What are you doing with your seas?

475
00:38:48.731 --> 00:38:52.743
You know how good a kiss is
conveys the feelings of the main characters.

476
00:38:52.767 --> 00:38:54.621
The plot is well thought out!

477
00:38:54.645 --> 00:38:58.821
This scene will go down in history
Korean cinema as the best.

478
00:38:59.161 --> 00:39:00.540
And you refuse?

479
00:39:06.553 --> 00:39:07.652
Can't be.

480
00:39:07.832 --> 00:39:10.290
Well, of course you agree!

481
00:39:11.029 --> 00:39:13.083
I'm giving you time to sober up, clean up...

482
00:39:13.107 --> 00:39:14.246
I don't agree.

483
00:39:14.346 --> 00:39:17.159
Why? Why? Why don't you want to?

484
00:39:17.183 --> 00:39:18.761
Give me a reason.

485
00:39:19.900 --> 00:39:21.239
It's a secret.

486
00:39:22.258 --> 00:39:23.357
OK.

487
00:39:23.696 --> 00:39:25.435
I'll just tell you.

488
00:39:35.644 --> 00:39:37.383
My girlfriend is against it.

489
00:39:38.282 --> 00:39:41.259
- Wow!
- She's jealous.

490
00:39:41.399 --> 00:39:43.017
A difficult case.

491
00:39:44.196 --> 00:39:45.730
And if she says to die, will you die?

492
00:39:45.754 --> 00:39:47.253
I'll pretend.

493
00:39:47.632 --> 00:39:48.687
I'm an actor.

494
00:39:48.711 --> 00:39:51.884
So pretend here
and not in front of your girlfriend!

495
00:39:51.908 --> 00:39:56.044
All. Until the stage is cleared,
I won't act.

496
00:39:56.903 --> 00:39:58.002
It's clear?

497
00:39:58.222 --> 00:39:59.600
I'll go.

498
00:39:59.780 --> 00:40:03.197
Wait. By... Wait. Until June.

499
00:40:03.656 --> 00:40:04.915
Do June!

500
00:40:06.054 --> 00:40:09.227
Filming isn't over yet
you can't just walk away.

501
00:40:09.251 --> 00:40:12.264
- No, no, I don't hear anything.
- Do Jun, Do Jun.

502
00:40:12.288 --> 00:40:15.021
The director wants to replace the actor,
if you...

503
00:40:15.045 --> 00:40:16.144
You know...

504
00:40:16.683 --> 00:40:19.740
that this film is being sponsored because of me?

505
00:40:22.398 --> 00:40:24.212
Come on. Until June.

506
00:40:24.236 --> 00:40:25.814
Do June, wait, let's...

507
00:40:29.231 --> 00:40:32.408
Wow. Shameless! I have no words!

508
00:40:36.064 --> 00:40:38.002
You were drinking. Are you crazy?

509
00:40:39.860 --> 00:40:42.278
Come out. Come out!

510
00:40:43.457 --> 00:40:46.074
Park Do Joon, are you even adequate?!

511
00:41:02.118 --> 00:41:03.736
Crap.

512
00:41:06.434 --> 00:41:08.567
-Are you crazy?
- What's wrong with this aunt?

513
00:41:08.591 --> 00:41:10.170
My God.

514
00:41:10.390 --> 00:41:13.367
You're the crazy one! Understood?
Get out, idiot!

515
00:41:16.464 --> 00:41:19.157
They kiss your feet here and you leave?

516
00:41:19.181 --> 00:41:21.994
Got drunk and got behind the wheel!
So you’re also taking a girl.

517
00:41:22.018 --> 00:41:23.473
This is attempted murder!

518
00:41:23.497 --> 00:41:26.434
If you want to die, die alone
What does she have to do with it?

519
00:41:32.967 --> 00:41:34.665
So you're a hooligan.

520
00:41:37.802 --> 00:41:39.940
- You? You...
- It's funny.

521
00:41:40.160 --> 00:41:41.455
Turn around again.

522
00:41:41.479 --> 00:41:43.936
- Quiet!
- What a pity.

523
00:41:45.355 --> 00:41:48.967
So, when the actor tried to leave
film set,

524
00:41:48.991 --> 00:41:50.845
did she stop him?

525
00:41:50.869 --> 00:41:55.005
Yes. First we would like
get an apology.

526
00:41:55.624 --> 00:41:57.523
What? An apology?

527
00:41:58.262 --> 00:42:00.759
Aren't you ashamed to say this yourself?

528
00:42:01.339 --> 00:42:03.996
Anyway, here's what happened
actually...

529
00:42:09.650 --> 00:42:11.349
They're calling you, answer.

530
00:42:16.603 --> 00:42:18.182
- Yes, general director.
- Salt!

531
00:42:18.242 --> 00:42:21.339
I told you to convince him.
How did you end up in the police?

532
00:42:21.439 --> 00:42:22.813
I'll explain everything.

533
00:42:22.837 --> 00:42:24.372
Apologize immediately.

534
00:42:24.396 --> 00:42:26.569
Don't create a scandal. Understood?

535
00:42:26.593 --> 00:42:27.692
What?

536
00:42:27.872 --> 00:42:32.128
- No, but that idiot Do Joon...
- He was with a girl, you know?

537
00:42:32.308 --> 00:42:34.925
Do you want the press to know about this?

538
00:42:35.105 --> 00:42:37.243
Do you want the filming to stop?

539
00:42:37.502 --> 00:42:39.361
Apologize and shut your mouth.

540
00:42:39.580 --> 00:42:41.199
Gendy... CEO!

541
00:42:42.977 --> 00:42:44.396
And what did they say?

542
00:42:48.571 --> 00:42:49.830
Excuse me.

543
00:42:50.050 --> 00:42:51.309
I'm sorry.

544
00:42:51.888 --> 00:42:53.746
It’s not me who needs to ask for forgiveness.

545
00:42:54.685 --> 00:42:57.303
And our artist who suffered.

546
00:42:57.522 --> 00:42:58.621
What?

547
00:43:03.237 --> 00:43:07.373
I'm already over 30, and I'm sitting in the police station
and I am writing a letter of apology.

548
00:43:09.750 --> 00:43:11.489
Hey! Gorgeous!

549
00:43:12.308 --> 00:43:14.246
Stop. A familiar face.

550
00:43:14.665 --> 00:43:16.324
Do you come here often?

551
00:43:17.662 --> 00:43:21.159
Stay quiet, I can't concentrate.

552
00:43:22.138 --> 00:43:24.236
Can I give you a few words?

553
00:43:24.376 --> 00:43:25.834
I'm a professional.

554
00:43:28.931 --> 00:43:31.664
What did you forget in the cell?
You're a detective.

555
00:43:31.688 --> 00:43:33.786
Temperature, humidity.

556
00:43:34.286 --> 00:43:35.385
Everything is better here.

557
00:43:36.523 --> 00:43:39.141
Surprisingly, it’s more convenient here,
than in the office.

558
00:43:39.960 --> 00:43:42.338
That's where you belong.

559
00:43:42.557 --> 00:43:43.976
Write faster.

560
00:43:44.276 --> 00:43:46.050
And don't be upset.

561
00:43:46.074 --> 00:43:47.213
Uncle will treat you.

562
00:43:47.712 --> 00:43:49.890
What other uncle? No need!

563
00:43:51.788 --> 00:43:53.642
Can I have your number?

564
00:43:53.666 --> 00:43:55.485
Write. I dictate.

565
00:43:55.664 --> 00:43:57.083
- Let's.
- 119.

566
00:43:59.301 --> 00:44:01.638
Help yourself, hooligan.

567
00:44:03.576 --> 00:44:07.109
Tae Sung! I didn't do anything, and you did me,
like being greeted from prison.

568
00:44:07.133 --> 00:44:08.751
Start with a clean slate.

569
00:44:08.931 --> 00:44:11.868
Although you have always been so brave.

570
00:44:12.328 --> 00:44:15.065
I remember how you were with the boys
took away the cigarettes.

571
00:44:16.204 --> 00:44:17.902
Watch yourself.

572
00:44:19.401 --> 00:44:22.657
So? How did you end up at the station?

573
00:44:24.755 --> 00:44:26.094
Driving drunk?

574
00:44:26.553 --> 00:44:28.012
I would have told you right away!

575
00:44:28.152 --> 00:44:29.526
He would have been checked.

576
00:44:29.550 --> 00:44:31.648
I said it, I said it.

577
00:44:32.587 --> 00:44:35.764
But the general director forced
me to apologize.

578
00:44:38.382 --> 00:44:41.958
That's not why I'm in this industry
tried to get in.

579
00:44:42.897 --> 00:44:44.036
Bitterly.

580
00:44:46.134 --> 00:44:48.348
Do you want me to look through all the cameras?

581
00:44:48.372 --> 00:44:52.304
If this idiot got behind the wheel drunk,
Same with the passenger, he will be punished!

582
00:44:52.328 --> 00:44:54.186
And then I will be fired.

583
00:44:54.525 --> 00:44:55.984
But thank you.

584
00:44:57.283 --> 00:44:58.382
Give it.

585
00:44:58.801 --> 00:45:00.380
Actually, I'm not kidding.

586
00:45:03.477 --> 00:45:04.775
No need.

587
00:45:08.232 --> 00:45:09.331
By the way...

588
00:45:09.670 --> 00:45:11.968
there was a model sitting next to him, right?

589
00:45:12.348 --> 00:45:13.846
- And what?
- Beautiful?

590
00:45:14.186 --> 00:45:15.285
Beautiful.

591
00:45:16.384 --> 00:45:19.640
Why is she dating him?
and not with me?

592
00:45:21.778 --> 00:45:24.556
Maybe In Hyuk can introduce me to someone?

593
00:45:26.334 --> 00:45:28.747
Do you think everyone wants to date you?

594
00:45:28.771 --> 00:45:30.665
God, God.

595
00:45:30.689 --> 00:45:33.267
You are no longer an internet star.

596
00:45:33.487 --> 00:45:35.545
But I'm still not bad looking.

597
00:45:36.883 --> 00:45:40.300
This smile with your eyes has been around for a long time
doesn't work.

598
00:45:40.959 --> 00:45:42.098
What a pity.

599
00:45:46.873 --> 00:45:49.131
Sung Jae was there before.

600
00:45:53.786 --> 00:45:57.958
Take your time. Otherwise you'll get drunk quickly.
I won't carry you home.

601
00:45:57.982 --> 00:46:00.799
Come on. I won't get drunk.

602
00:46:01.059 --> 00:46:03.996
I really want to, but I can’t even do it.

603
00:46:04.535 --> 00:46:08.787
World, why are you doing this to me?

604
00:46:08.811 --> 00:46:13.187
- What did I do to deserve all this? I don't understand!
- Let go!

605
00:46:13.287 --> 00:46:14.985
Shut up a little.

606
00:46:16.084 --> 00:46:18.781
God. That idiot Park Do Joon.

607
00:46:18.881 --> 00:46:21.618
- I won’t calm down!
- Of course, you won’t calm down.

608
00:46:23.277 --> 00:46:25.095
Why did you drink so much?

609
00:46:26.354 --> 00:46:28.012
You can't catch a taxi.

610
00:46:28.352 --> 00:46:30.010
And it's freezing outside.

611
00:46:33.866 --> 00:46:35.604
You'll choke me.

612
00:46:38.741 --> 00:46:39.840
Are you sleeping?

613
00:46:42.338 --> 00:46:43.437
OK.

614
00:46:43.696 --> 00:46:44.835
Then sleep.

615
00:46:45.335 --> 00:46:46.434
So.

616
00:46:57.882 --> 00:46:58.981
God.

617
00:47:13.906 --> 00:47:15.005
Has it snowed?

618
00:47:16.304 --> 00:47:17.802
Without a taxi there is no way.

619
00:48:00.380 --> 00:48:01.479
Salt...

620
00:48:02.018 --> 00:48:03.117
you tell me...

621
00:48:05.734 --> 00:48:06.833
I like you very much.

622
00:48:08.452 --> 00:48:12.747
Sol, don't run away anymore.
And don't hide your feelings.

623
00:48:13.766 --> 00:48:16.743
I'll die saving you, and that's okay.

624
00:48:17.243 --> 00:48:18.342
I don't care.

625
00:48:23.716 --> 00:48:25.175
You say you're bored.

626
00:48:26.434 --> 00:48:27.533
Something...

627
00:48:28.711 --> 00:48:29.810
...changed?

628
00:48:43.097 --> 00:48:44.316
I like you.

629
00:48:46.853 --> 00:48:48.512
I like you, Sung Jae.

630
00:48:52.408 --> 00:48:53.507
I love you.

631
00:48:55.285 --> 00:48:56.424
I love you, Sol.

632
00:49:03.477 --> 00:49:04.935
There is no taxi.

633
00:49:07.153 --> 00:49:08.731
Let's. Let's go.

634
00:49:17.542 --> 00:49:18.641
Are you crying?

635
00:49:31.489 --> 00:49:32.707
Calm down.

636
00:49:41.758 --> 00:49:43.217
Song Jae...

637
00:49:43.836 --> 00:49:44.935
What?

638
00:49:47.473 --> 00:49:49.810
Sun Jae, I miss you.

639
00:50:18.601 --> 00:50:19.780
How's it going at work?

640
00:50:21.239 --> 00:50:23.816
I don't even remember how I returned.

641
00:50:24.076 --> 00:50:26.733
Thank you for carrying me home yesterday.

642
00:50:26.793 --> 00:50:28.691
You can't put a thank you in your pocket.

643
00:50:28.991 --> 00:50:30.210
Will you treat me?

644
00:50:31.309 --> 00:50:33.167
Good for the police.

645
00:50:33.227 --> 00:50:36.084
Next time.
Today I am rectifying the situation.

646
00:50:43.856 --> 00:50:45.275
I feel so bad.

647
00:51:03.756 --> 00:51:06.893
Park Do Joon refused to film.

648
00:51:07.912 --> 00:51:12.404
If funding stops,
I will sue Park Do Joon.

649
00:51:12.428 --> 00:51:15.525
Because he was the one who ruined our filming.

650
00:51:15.944 --> 00:51:18.238
But you said not to stir up a scandal.

651
00:51:18.262 --> 00:51:23.796
I didn't know this bastard
got behind the wheel drunk.

652
00:51:24.376 --> 00:51:27.668
Why didn't you say anything?
about the most important thing, Sol?!

653
00:51:27.692 --> 00:51:28.791
Why?

654
00:51:28.971 --> 00:51:32.028
You told me to shut my mouth.

655
00:51:32.088 --> 00:51:33.187
I?

656
00:51:33.526 --> 00:51:34.625
Yes.

657
00:51:34.885 --> 00:51:36.344
Damn it.

658
00:51:39.321 --> 00:51:40.540
OK.

659
00:51:40.959 --> 00:51:43.537
I'll figure it out myself. Forget.

660
00:51:44.196 --> 00:51:46.334
I should have protected you.

661
00:51:46.513 --> 00:51:48.092
And also this letter.

662
00:51:52.667 --> 00:51:53.766
Sorry.

663
00:51:54.825 --> 00:51:56.360
What? I didn't hear.

664
00:51:56.384 --> 00:51:57.483
Sorry.

665
00:52:00.220 --> 00:52:02.717
Nothing. Thank you.

666
00:52:03.257 --> 00:52:07.069
By the way, you told me last time
showed the script.

667
00:52:07.093 --> 00:52:08.671
Bring it tomorrow.

668
00:52:09.131 --> 00:52:11.185
But it seems you didn't like him.

669
00:52:11.209 --> 00:52:12.747
What are you doing?

670
00:52:12.847 --> 00:52:15.021
Listen, I re-read it and understood it,

671
00:52:15.045 --> 00:52:18.022
that it will turn out to be quite a good melodrama
for teenagers.

672
00:52:18.761 --> 00:52:21.818
- So...
- Let's make a film...

673
00:52:22.278 --> 00:52:23.936
according to your scenario.

674
00:52:25.395 --> 00:52:29.491
Is it true? Thank you, thank you,
CEO Lee!

675
00:52:29.990 --> 00:52:32.807
My pleasure. You know
how much I appreciate you.

676
00:52:33.347 --> 00:52:34.961
Don't forget it, asshole.

677
00:52:34.985 --> 00:52:36.683
I won't forget. I won't forget.

678
00:52:36.943 --> 00:52:38.162
Certainly.

679
00:52:39.500 --> 00:52:42.118
- What is this? Budget plan?
- Yes.

680
00:52:45.175 --> 00:52:46.274
And this?

681
00:52:51.648 --> 00:52:54.146
Did you know that I would approve your script?

682
00:52:54.805 --> 00:52:57.383
So glad you wrote the letter?

683
00:53:00.240 --> 00:53:02.218
I'll read it before bed.

684
00:53:05.195 --> 00:53:07.932
What are you doing? Go finalize the script.

685
00:53:08.951 --> 00:53:11.768
Fine. I will try! Thank you!

686
00:53:16.184 --> 00:53:18.797
What kind of things are these? Congratulations!

687
00:53:18.821 --> 00:53:21.554
And luck smiled on me, Hyun Joo!

688
00:53:21.578 --> 00:53:24.432
I didn't even think that the CEO
appreciates me so much.

689
00:53:24.456 --> 00:53:26.114
And yesterday I swore.

690
00:53:30.729 --> 00:53:31.828
What's happened?

691
00:53:32.408 --> 00:53:33.463
Envelope.

692
00:53:33.487 --> 00:53:34.586
What?

693
00:53:34.725 --> 00:53:35.824
Shut your mouth?

694
00:53:36.364 --> 00:53:38.701
Who else should shut their mouth here?

695
00:53:40.959 --> 00:53:44.332
Yes. Damn company. I'm quitting!

696
00:53:44.356 --> 00:53:48.128
I settled here
to write scripts,

697
00:53:48.152 --> 00:53:52.488
and not deal with all sorts of idiots!

698
00:54:01.419 --> 00:54:03.153
"Figure it out yourself!"

699
00:54:03.177 --> 00:54:07.149
That's what you, dear CEO Lee,
they told me, Lim Sol.

700
00:54:07.173 --> 00:54:09.031
Remember?

701
00:54:09.331 --> 00:54:15.505
How can you say such things
to an ordinary employee who made a mistake?

702
00:54:15.684 --> 00:54:18.062
I'm beside myself with anger!

703
00:54:18.322 --> 00:54:22.454
This is my first resignation letter.

704
00:54:22.478 --> 00:54:24.771
It's time to get out of this office!

705
00:54:24.795 --> 00:54:29.650
I got a job with you because I dreamed
write scripts,

706
00:54:30.230 --> 00:54:33.802
not because I wanted to run
for stupid stars

707
00:54:33.826 --> 00:54:35.760
and indulge their whims!

708
00:54:35.784 --> 00:54:38.641
I'm tired of doing this

709
00:54:38.701 --> 00:54:41.998
That's why I won't show up at work again!

710
00:54:42.537 --> 00:54:45.111
Like this. Fuck this job!

711
00:54:45.135 --> 00:54:46.953
CEO Lee Kyung Ja.

712
00:54:47.093 --> 00:54:48.951
Hey Kyung Ja!

713
00:54:49.011 --> 00:54:52.268
Try to sit over these pieces of paper yourself
every day for such a salary!

714
00:54:52.368 --> 00:54:55.221
Do I, a grown woman, really have to
write a letter of apology at the police station?

715
00:54:55.245 --> 00:54:57.938
I hope you get it
smarter employee

716
00:54:57.962 --> 00:55:00.340
who will be ready to decide
your problems!

717
00:55:00.440 --> 00:55:06.574
And if you suddenly want me to stay,
you'll have to run after me.

718
00:55:06.753 --> 00:55:09.486
And it’s even harder to convince me,

719
00:55:09.510 --> 00:55:13.083
than that idiot Park Do Joon.

720
00:55:13.107 --> 00:55:17.159
I'm Lim Sol!

721
00:55:17.183 --> 00:55:18.562
Kyung Ja!

722
00:55:19.141 --> 00:55:21.435
It was disgusting working with you.

723
00:55:21.459 --> 00:55:23.636
I hope we never meet again.

724
00:55:23.696 --> 00:55:25.910
I'm leaving, happy to stay!

725
00:55:25.934 --> 00:55:26.989
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

726
00:55:27.013 --> 00:55:28.751
Figure it out yourself!

727
00:55:32.607 --> 00:55:33.706
What to do?

728
00:55:34.645 --> 00:55:35.984
What should I do?

729
00:55:36.244 --> 00:55:37.299
Bye bye!

730
00:55:37.323 --> 00:55:39.217
This is a complete failure.

731
00:55:39.241 --> 00:55:43.057
After this you can say
to your script "Bye-bye!"

732
00:55:43.516 --> 00:55:45.730
She said she would read it before bed.

733
00:55:45.754 --> 00:55:46.853
Stop!

734
00:55:47.113 --> 00:55:48.572
But she's already gone.

735
00:55:48.671 --> 00:55:50.530
What? Where did you go?

736
00:56:11.888 --> 00:56:13.626
There is no use in pretending.

737
00:56:13.886 --> 00:56:16.304
What if they ask me what am I doing here?

738
00:56:16.883 --> 00:56:18.861
How do I get an envelope out of my bag?

739
00:56:29.910 --> 00:56:31.009
Great.

740
00:56:50.410 --> 00:56:52.827
Hello, good evening.

741
00:56:54.486 --> 00:56:56.384
- For you!
- Hooray!

742
00:57:16.583 --> 00:57:17.682
What...

743
00:57:32.368 --> 00:57:35.265
Thank God. She hasn't opened it yet.

744
00:57:36.004 --> 00:57:37.862
And let's put this in place.

745
00:57:55.065 --> 00:57:56.643
Song Jae!

746
00:58:01.419 --> 00:58:04.156
Song Jae!

747
00:58:15.724 --> 00:58:17.782
Song Jae!

748
00:58:19.880 --> 00:58:21.898
Song Jae!

749
00:58:24.316 --> 00:58:26.893
Song Jae-eh!

750
00:58:34.066 --> 00:58:37.323
When did they turn
into a time machine?

751
00:58:37.982 --> 00:58:40.440
And it started after your death.

752
00:58:40.500 --> 00:58:42.358
What can I tell you?

753
00:58:46.494 --> 00:58:48.272
Really... No.

754
00:58:52.607 --> 00:58:53.826
Song Jae...

755
00:58:54.166 --> 00:58:55.624
maybe we...

756
00:58:55.804 --> 00:58:58.502
there was no need to meet.

757
00:59:05.075 --> 00:59:07.772
Yes, there was no need.

758
01:00:15.964 --> 01:00:17.263
Song Jae...

759
01:00:50.130 --> 01:00:53.187
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

760
01:00:53.526 --> 01:00:54.785
Why are you crying?

761
01:00:54.885 --> 01:00:56.144
I'm not crying.

762
01:00:56.523 --> 01:00:58.298
- This film...
- Sun Jae!

763
01:00:58.322 --> 01:01:01.534
I shouldn't date her anymore.

764
01:01:01.558 --> 01:01:05.331
I wish you would refuse
from this role, Sung Jae.

765
01:01:05.355 --> 01:01:07.333
Why would she hate me?

766
01:01:07.512 --> 01:01:09.930
Sol, did something happen to you?

767
01:01:10.150 --> 01:01:12.448
Maybe you saw him?

768
01:01:12.667 --> 01:01:14.006
So we met.

769
01:01:14.066 --> 01:01:16.440
Apparently, this is fate.

770
01:01:16.464 --> 01:01:19.800
I won't let fate stop me.

771
01:01:20.300 --> 01:01:23.996
That is, if I agree,
then I will certainly die?

772
01:01:24.096 --> 01:01:27.828
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

773
01:01:27.852 --> 01:01:30.989
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

